{
  "_readme": "DESIGN TOKENS. Every color, font, radius, shadow and motion value the site uses lives here. Edit and refresh: tokens are read server-side per request and emitted as CSS custom properties, so no rebuild is needed. `mode` sets the browser color-scheme (scrollbars, form controls) and must match the palette. Text colors are checked at 4.5:1 or better against every background and surface; re-check after changing either. `signal` is reserved for live-status marks and never used for text.",
